body:

Interested in field recording, acoustics, or related research? Get in touch: [gewenxin.yu@proton.me](mailto:gewenxin.yu@proton.me).

## Join as members

To join the MAN network as an associate member, contact us by [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/@mantle_sound) (direct message) or [email](mailto:gewenxin.yu@proton.me). Include a short introduction to your background and any relevant links (e.g. portfolio, website).

No membership fees are required.

## Field collaborators

### Local recording assistant

We occasionally look for local recording assistants to support field recordings and related sessions. If you are based in or near our activity areas (Chengdu, Sichuan, China) and interested in helping with on-site recording logistics and coordination, please include **[Local recording assistant]** in the subject line when you write.

## Frequently Asked Questions

### Who can request to join?

The request to join the MAN network is open to individuals regardless of nationality or academic background. We welcome anyone who shares an interest in sound, field work, and mountain environments.

### When can I expect a response?

We usually respond within five business days.

### How do we communicate after an inquiry?

We typically follow up by email. Members are encouraged to use [Matrix](https://matrix.org/) or other FOSS communication tools where practical.

### Questions or concerns?

If you have any questions about the network or membership, please reach out by email or Mastodon.


[^1]: If Chinese is not your native language, you need approximately B1–B2 English to communicate with us smoothly. We encourage learning Chinese where helpful and can offer limited support in that regard.
